      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CHIVAS CHOICE (4) bolted home by 4.5 lengths (28.59) at this track last time from box 7. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Great chance to get the job done again. MIZUKI HEART (1) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 6 lengths into second (28.82) at this track in a Grade 4/5 over 498m. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Expected to be in the finish again. LOCHINVAR DUDE (7) shapes well after a decent run last time, finishing third in a Grade 4/5 at this track in 28.85. Harder here but will be in this for a long way. WEATHER REPORT (2) has top-three aspirations after placing here over this journey last time.",
